{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ultimate How-to-Socialize video game for introverts!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social Caterpillar is a game about an introvert who exercises their social skills like a muscle. Social interactions are framed as puzzles that need solved. The more you solve, the more energy you have to venture further from home. Explore a sequence of nuanced dioramas about the small hurdles of social anxiety!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve people like puzzles!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a myriad of puzzles, each with its own internal logic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the order you want to tackle each interaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logical abstractions require you to think and test</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Increase your Social Energy!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up with each successful puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain the energy and tools to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secret areas and extra hidden layers</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3514940?t=1755786817","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514940/db03d17b30a10c95b5fb0d672757d58d4fdc8e7b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755786817","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514940/a9eabe083314b5d30de8f138ee55725865b86ce7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755786817","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514940/a9eabe083314b5d30de8f138ee55725865b86ce7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755786817","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","det